    "title": "Mel's Sports History: James Buddy McGirt - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By 7 News Staff ,\n17 hours ago WATERTOWN, New York (WWNY) - James Buddy McGirt was a professional boxer from 1982 to 1997, compiling a record of 73 wins, including 48 by knockouts, 6 losses, and one draw. He won two World Titles, the IBF Junior Welterweight crown and the WBC Welterweight Belt. An outstanding pro career. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
